{"key":"StoryData/P10113.json|/dataList/13/content","kr_sha":"54d9a71e12f89f353abfe8e18bd305333aaf3ac5fb0eb24994ba7f344ee5e38a","zh":"在這之中也有和我共度那溫暖時代的親友。他應該也認為那個空間非常壓抑吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10113.json|/dataList/14/content","kr_sha":"1f10502a696d8d459d79d1fa3051fa9aeb731cb481918b2917b8624ec9a6399b","zh":"因此，當我努力將自身價值融入其技術且在這新築之巢綻放出來時，他才會露出這麼開心的表情吧。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10113.json|/dataList/15/content","kr_sha":"3c1db0230d92e5780b04b6705ad0175a7c0a365b64a14cf19245a3b17510f4c5","zh":"……從我開始研究至今，到底流逝了多少時光？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
