{"key":"StoryData/P10113.json|/dataList/19/content","kr_sha":"9f6a137d5f3cebfc0ab5cbdc3b65e0bdd6d70ca064ba05119c584a848067e6de","zh":"提取這套裝備和進行調整時，我都曾想介入……但赫爾曼董事並無給予我這樣的機會。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10113.json|/dataList/20/content","kr_sha":"f3a8022cf5d9ace43908990423295d8af6af5f33454dd512379ab2cc980c4dfd","zh":"如何。作為研究員卻被奪去「研究」這個本分，轉而拿起沉重槍枝的感覺。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10113.json|/dataList/21/content","kr_sha":"99b77449d621c2ad1a4ef5dbf24bd6f34b03743849e91f598ca5e3bbc51caac1","zh":"……啊，連這也都想不太起來。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10113.json|/dataList/22/content","kr_sha":"41b2320c41766d1aa1e39d4dd2b5a1d26cdfdf22eb9ec183c89d4e2e3200dff1","zh":"這也許是侵蝕這個特性所導致而成。我除了擊穿某物之外，無法感覺到任何特殊情感。偶爾，我會將手伸向脖子上的吊墜並試著打開它，但是……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10113.json|/dataList/23/content","kr_sha":"e0207f7b97cba52ca616ad4f093ddbbc295132d43479191341b71abf9f0fa882","zh":"我的子彈會貫穿我的同僚。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
